OL,3,GNEWSAFirework displays axed as wildfire
OL,4,Athreat continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirework displays at Poole and
OL,7,FBournemouth have been cancelled because
OL,8,Fof ongoing wildfire risks and the
OL,9,Fstrain on emergency services.
OL,11,FBCP Council said while the fireworks
OL,12,Fare set-off from the sea "all it takes
OL,13,Fis one stray spark to start a fire -
OL,14,Fthat's not a risk we're willing to take
OL,15,Fin these conditions."
OL,17,FThe council said some people would be
OL,18,Fdisappointed, but that most residents
OL,19,Ffelt cancelling the displays was the
OL,20,Fright thing to do.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
