OL,3,GNEWSAFirework displays axed as wildfire
OL,4,Athreat continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe displays were due to take place  at
OL,7,FPoole Quay on Thursday and Bournemouth
OL,8,Fbeach on Friday. It is the second week
OL,9,Fin a row that the Bournemouth seafront
OL,10,Fdisplay has been cancelled.
